      "featured-content": {
        "type": "featured-content",
        "settings": {
          "title": "What Does \"BLACKGROUND\" Mean?",
          "text": "<p>The name BLACKGROUND is intentionally layered. On the surface, it’s a play on the word background—but instead of being something behind the scenes or overlooked, <strong>it brings what is foundational in Black identity to the forefront</strong>. It’s about reclaiming our narratives and expressing our presence unapologetically. </p><p>At Blackground Clothing, we see fashion not as a trend but as a cultural language. Every stitch, every silhouette, every color story is a <strong>form of storytelling</strong>—a wearable declaration of pride, resilience, and innovation born out of the Black experience. </p>",
          "align_text": "center",
          "narrow_column": true,
